bind Impact Opportunity Identify: ID Opportunity
bind Due Diligence Conduct: ID Opportunity, Level Risk
bind Funding Secure: ID Investor, Amount Investment
bind Impact Measure: Metric Impact
bind Returns Distribute: ROI Expected, ID Investor
bind Feedback Gather: Feedback Stakeholder
bind Investment Exit: Strategy Exit
bind Performance Evaluate: Score Performance
ID Opportunity: integer between 1 and 99999
ROI Expected: float between 0 and 100
Level Risk: Low, Medium, High
ID Investor: integer between 1 and 9999
Investment Type: Equity, Debt, Grant
Amount Investment: float between 1000 and 10000000
Metric Impact: Social, Environmental, Economic
Feedback Stakeholder: Positive, Neutral, Negative
Strategy Exit: Acquisition, Public Offering, Liquidation
Score Performance: integer between 1 and 10
